          "settings": {
            "question": "What payment methods do you accept?",
            "text": "<p>We accept all major UPI apps (GPay, PhonePe, Paytm), credit/debit cards (Visa, Mastercard, RuPay), net banking, and Cash on Delivery (COD) for orders up to 5,000 <br/><br/></p>"
